<description>&lt;p&gt;Hezbollah continues to fire rockets and artillery at Israeli positions in southern Lebanon while Israel carries out air strikes on Hezbollah sites, causing civilian casualties. In northern Israel a Hezbollah submunition exploded in a teenager's backpack, killing Elazar Yair Wilensky and wounding dozens, prompting an IDF investigation. Lebanese olive harvests proceed under the threat of drones and warplanes, and UN peacekeepers are withdrawing from Lebanon after pressure from Israel. Qatar has pledged reconstruction funding and announced a large solar plant project for southern Lebanon. The UCDP recorded 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOay1OU1NEWlN3RUVrT00xUEZ4ZUFGeUpBaEQtajFkY3k0VkxRRzlEQTVYSVVyQlZHcVpRUVhsWWFKTGtoVFV4M21LUG1TQWF2dEd0N1NaVGl2b19kN2tiMUg5VmViSEZhMFIyVmxENXBMNFVSRlRKTWZjSGVPMHdVQWw1VE5YQ0d2Vi1ZS3psVXFXbUJ2cmJKSXVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNZVl0TGpOWEkxSmtRaTJzblp6d19RRV9aZS0yX09ZWWc5cHYxeUllczZHdUJNQXktMXZta1RVc2hPYkpSWWNmN1lfa1FadDVIYnEzZnl4TGg5Sl9ueVhOa2U0a0hxbVRiaHRfR09fSG9xZU5kZURQSmtJRTF3S205bkFtZVhZbEpZOFZ2LS1tci1BRW1JNHg3U0ZRbHF6REhObWxrRE1pajhTYVh1emJ2S1NEMGJvcjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera Centre for Studies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNVkpPcGh4MlRFTlJRV00yWUUxV0xHWTg2enBybWM4TFlQeGRXcUY0a25uYng4a0tOU3E3dmN0NDlOMm1jWXNndVhVVzRLa3dYWTRnVHNOYXhaYlNlVk1zeUt6NmFvallrN19BbHZ6X2VmN3Q5UmVyNWlRUUxKbEpqSkd2RV85aVhfYm1iXzFWWS1SbmdlZWczVXZpclpQSUcxZTJQWUE3MXVIZzRCZThRdDNuQ2VCTG1x0gG-AUFVX3lxTE9sNlNidnNTci1Vank1SWVqRExDeEJKSzdpaHZCc2tzbHZkM29MWlZQc2FGRFluVGN3VzdjS3dhc2t5RHhDZXZmdEtzbTFvejhoMzgtcV